	(text "BUCK B — +5V_SERVO, 5–10 A, same LM5145 design as Buck A with the 5 V divider\nSeparate sheet file on purpose: KiCad shares symbol values between sheet instances, and D1 option (b) deletes this rail entirely.\nGolden reference: datasheets/reference/ti-snvu545-lm5145evm-hd-20a.pdf, datasheets/lm5145.pdf\nConsumes: +19V_IN, GND.  Produces: +5V_SERVO — NEVER merged with +5V_USB (HARDWARE.md §5).\nName the switch node SW and the bootstrap node BOOT (SW_NODE net class by pattern).\nOpen items: D1\nBring-up: test point + power-good LED on +5V_SERVO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
